# GoogleAI
# Policy: Proxy
# Last reviewed: 2026-10-22
# Scope: Google AI surfaces — Gemini app/API, AI Studio, Gemini Notebook (NotebookLM),
# Jules, Antigravity, Stitch, Flow, Opal, Google Labs, Code Assist, Vertex AI, DeepMind.
# Shared Google hosts (auth, API frontends, gstatic) are included only because the
# AI clients need them; they are not Google-AI-exclusive.
# This is a routing list, not an exhaustive firewall allowlist.

# Gemini app / Gemini API
# https://gemini.google.com/  https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs
DOMAIN,geminiweb-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,gemini.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativeai.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# Google AI Studio / MakerSuite
# https://aistudio.google.com/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com
DOMAIN,cloudconsole-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,alkalicore-pa.clients6.google.com
DOMAIN,alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com

# Gemini Notebook (formerly NotebookLM)
# notebooklm.google.com 301s to the current host notebook.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebook.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com

# Gemini Code Assist / Gemini CLI / Cloud Code agent backend
# https://codeassist.google/  https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,geller-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aisandbox-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aida.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,cloudaicompanion.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,codeassist.google

# Jules
# https://jules.google.com/
DOMAIN,jules.google.com

# Antigravity (desktop + web Remote Control)
# https://antigravity.google/  https://antigravity.google.com/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antigravity.google.com

# Stitch
# https://stitch.google.com/ (canonical)  https://stitch.withgoogle.com/ (still serving)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stitch.google.com
DOMAIN,stitch.withgoogle.com

# Flow / Flow Music (Absorbed Whisk and ImageFX)
# labs.google/fx/tools/flow 308s to flow.google.com; flowmusic.google 301s to flowmusic.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,flow.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,flowmusic.app

# Opal
# opal.withgoogle.com 301s to opal.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,opal.google
DOMAIN,appcatalyst.pa.googleapis.com

# Google Labs (Whisk, Mixboard, Pomelli, Project Genie, AI Test Kitchen)
# labs.google.com 301s to labs.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,labs.google

# Vertex AI / Gemini API on Google Cloud
# Regional endpoints are <region>-aiplatform.googleapis.com, e.g. us-central1-aiplatform.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,aiplatform.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,*-aiplatform.googleapis.com

# DeepMind
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google

# Gemini in Colab
DOMAIN,colab.research.google.com

# Shared Google infrastructure (sign-in, API frontends, static assets, storage, safe browsing)
# Also used by non-AI Google services; keep only if the AI clients need them.
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,apis.google.com
DOMAIN,www.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,safebrowsing.googleapis.com
# Antigravity installers / public AI assets are served from GCS buckets
DOMAIN,storage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,ssl.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,www.gstatic.com